        "id": "G0AU7Uq7UzR3"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This project focuses on performing data cleaning, preprocessing, and exploratory data analysis (EDA) on the Amazon Prime TV Shows & Movies dataset containing approximately 9,800+ titles.\n",
        "\n",
        "The dataset includes information such as title, type, release year, duration, genres, ratings, directors, cast, countries, and descriptions. The objective is to clean the dataset, identify trends, and generate business insights using Python."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Rqn77o5PU0uG"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# BUSINESS OBJECTIVE"
