        "\n",
        "*   Understanding TV Shows vs Movies distribution\n",
        "*   Identifying popular genres\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "*   Analyzing content released over the years\n",
        "*   Finding top producing countries\n",
        "\n",
        "*   Exploring ratings distribution\n",
        "*   Understanding content duration patterns\n",
        "\n",
        "*  Supporting data-driven content acquisition decisions\n",
        "\n",
