        "# PHASE 9 — INSIGHTS SECTION"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "muhj_1iLZ9OE"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Key Insights\n",
        "1.Movies make up the majority of Amazon Prime's content library.\n",
        "\n",
        "2.The platform experienced significant growth in content additions after 2015.\n",
        "\n",
        "3.Drama, Comedy, and Documentary are among the most common genres.\n",
        "\n",
        "4.The United States contributes the largest share of available content.\n",
        "\n",
        "5.Most movies have durations between 80–120 minutes.\n",
        "\n",
        "6.TV Shows generally consist of 1–2 seasons, indicating a focus on shorter series.\n",
        "\n",
        "7.Most content is rated TV-MA, TV-14, or R, suggesting a strong adult audience.\n",
        "\n",
        "8.Several directors and actors appear across multiple titles, highlighting recurring collaborations.\n",
        "\n",
        "9.Some metadata fields such as Director and Cast contain substantial missing values, emphasizing the importance of data cleaning.\n",
        "\n",
        "10.The cleaned dataset provides a reliable foundation for business reporting and content strategy analysis."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "U0oHC4v7aANG"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# CONCLUSION"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "bXs1pqIgaRrm"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "In this project, an end-to-end data cleaning and exploratory data analysis process was performed on the Amazon Prime TV Shows & Movies dataset. Missing values were handled, duplicate records were removed, date fields were standardized, and new analytical features were created. Various visualizations were used to identify trends in content type, genre popularity, release years, ratings, duration, and country-wise distribution. The analysis provides meaningful business insights that can support strategic decisions related to content acquisition, audience targeting, and platform growth."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "uxTzvj8maUTW"
      }
    }
